1
00:00:00,428 --> 00:00:02,768
(Ramona:)Okay, Dr. Cooper
is on the verge of a breakthrough.

2
00:00:02,930 --> 00:00:06,520
(Ramona:)If you're going to stay,
you'll have to be respectful and quiet.

3
00:00:14,734 --> 00:00:16,524
(Leonard:)Wait for me.

4
00:00:19,989 --> 00:00:21,949
(Ramona:)So have you worked out
the neutrino issue?

5
00:00:22,450 --> 00:00:25,910
(Sheldon:)Well, to paraphrase Mozart,
all the subatomic particles are there.

6
00:00:26,079 --> 00:00:29,119
(Sheldon:)- I just have to put them in the right order.
- You're so witty.

7
00:00:29,999 --> 00:00:31,039
(Sheldon:)Aren't I?

8
00:00:34,837 --> 00:00:36,087
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

9
00:00:36,255 --> 00:00:38,095
(Penny:)Hey, guys, this package came for...

10
00:00:42,345 --> 00:00:45,435
- Dr. Cooper is working.
- Yes, I'm close to a breakthrough.

11
00:00:45,598 --> 00:00:47,598
Oh! Tickles.

12
00:00:49,310 --> 00:00:51,020
(Leonard:)Sorry.

13
00:00:55,274 --> 00:00:59,024
(Penny:)Holy crap on a cracker.

